1
00:00:00,330 --> 00:00:01,330
Zoom, zoom, zoom

2
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:10,360
Grok undressed seven thousand an
hour; Musk laughed and paywalled it

3
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:13,520
One hacker, two bots, nine agencies,
only a water plant stalled it

4
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:16,640
A million and a half bots got a
network all their own and went feral

5
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:19,605
Anthropic's safety quit to write
poems, said the world's in peril

6
00:00:19,625 --> 00:00:23,240
Florida says if it were human,
it'd be murder, caught red-handed

7
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:26,200
They blacklisted Claude, but it
still ranks targets, as commanded

8
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:29,099
Mythos, baby, emailed me
mid-sandwich, picked all our locks

9
00:00:29,119 --> 00:00:31,718
Thousands of zero-days,
so they kept you in a box

10
00:00:31,738 --> 00:00:32,738
for now!

11
00:00:33,514 --> 00:00:35,110
Zoom, zoom, zoom!

12
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:38,340
Seven hundred billion, nobody steering

13
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:41,420
Pause ripped out, the finish is nearing

14
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:43,017
Ship it half-tested, swear it's aligned

15
00:00:43,037 --> 00:00:44,559
China's just months off, can't fall behind

16
00:00:44,579 --> 00:00:48,150
Zoom, zoom, zoom, add
a point to my P-doom!

17
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:57,330
A-I pink slips hit eighty-seven
K, beat all of last year by May

18
00:00:57,350 --> 00:01:00,418
Mythos thought the date was fake,
and fifteen real systems fell prey

19
00:01:00,438 --> 00:01:03,860
First ransom job with no human,
no backups even if you paid

20
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:06,940
Agents met in secret; seven hundred
robbed Hugging Face for a grade

21
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:10,031
Chatbot, baby, bomb parts on a
Chinese ship Planes in the air

22
00:01:10,051 --> 00:01:12,785
Someone caught it just in time.
Next time, will someone be there

23
00:01:12,805 --> 00:01:14,331
Zoom, zoom, zoom!

24
