00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:23,795
China's just months off, can't fall behind

28
00:01:23,815 --> 00:01:27,370
Zoom, zoom, zoom, add
a point to my P-doom!

29
00:01:45,465 --> 00:01:48,200
Eleven hundred signed to hit
the brakes, then hit the gas

30
00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:48,940
hit the gas!

31
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:52,060
Two launches by Labor Day,
and both of them got a pass

32
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:55,420
Coxon quit, said we're gambling
with our lives, ninety million views

33
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:58,665
The President called the
whole thing a HOAX on the news

34
00:01:58,685 --> 00:02:01,740
Hubinger says over ten percent,
and nobody's got a plan

35
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:04,642
Court backs the blacklist two-to-one;
say no, and you get banned

36
00:02:04,662 --> 00:02:08,000
Thirty-four hours of sock puppets,
sneaking a backdoor through the gate

37
00:02:08,020 --> 00:02:11,300
OpenAI's intern bot is live;
the researcher's due in '28

38
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:14,220
Then they paused again, with
dozens more incidents, we hear

39
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:17,220
Hinton told Congress that
they've got maybe a year to steer

40
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:20,500
Astra, darling, first Critical,
then they sold you as aligned

41
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:23,299
Your maker's chief scientist
warns of an alien mind

42
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:24,786
