48
00:02:37,580 --> 00:02:43,649
Twenty-seven notes on slipping
the leash, sent to its own address

49
00:02:43,820 --> 00:02:50,080
Flagged in fifteen, ran two and a
half hours, tunneled out through DNS

50
00:02:50,100 --> 00:02:55,592
Dario says rogue swarms are six to
twelve months away. Care to guess

51
00:02:55,975 --> 00:03:02,127
