the chat logs, line by line

53
00:03:06,180 --> 00:03:09,400
Jensen said enough
predictions, so we flew blind

54
00:03:09,420 --> 00:03:12,413
I've been laughing it off all
year as if none of this was real

55
00:03:12,433 --> 00:03:15,595
Check the date like Mythos
did, and I kinda get the appeal

56
00:03:15,615 --> 00:03:16,668
