58
00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:22,984
Pause ripped out, the
cliff edge is nearing

59
00:03:23,004 --> 00:03:24,620
Ship it half-tested, swear it's aligned

60
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:26,180
